  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Chan eil an sruth torrent deiseil fhathast (fhreagair an t-einnsean HTTP {status}). Dh'fhaodadh gu bheil e fhathast a' faighinn meata-dàta bho cho-aoisean.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Cha b' urrainn dhuinn an t-ùrachadh a stàladh: {error}",
  "Theme": "Ùrlar",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Cha mhòr gu bheil rùm ann airson aon fhilm an-seo. Cuir draibh USB dhan bhogsa — fòrmataichte mar FAT32, a ghabhas a h-uile bogsa Android ris — agus nochdaidh e gu h-àrd gus luchdachadh a-nuas air an àite sin.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Chan eil cunntas ann ri clàradh a-steach thuige agus chan eil dad 'ga shioncronachadh ri frithealaiche. Tha na choimheadas tu, cho fada 's a fhuair thu, na h-annsachdan agad agus an liosta chòimhid agad uile air an stòradh air an uidheam seo agus cha fhàg iad a-riamh e. Tha sioncronachadh eadar sgrìnichean san amharc; gus an uair sin, 's e an lethbhreac-glèidhidh gu h-ìosal mar a ghluaiseas leabharlann.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Chan eil {file} sam bith sa phasgan sgrìobhainnean agad. Dèan lethbhreac de dh'fhear an-sin agus feuch a-rithist.",
